        "official_en_sha256": "2f001766f682803414d20d1125cc4abd69d5389b714436ff8e185e1fe8ac4156"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "７００年間、クリスタルに封印されて私は悟った。\r\n世界は、生き物は、全て醜い。\r\n命は唾棄すべき存在だ。",
        "official_en": "When I was sealed away for seven hundred years in that Crystal, I had an epiphany: Life itself...is detestable. I realized that this world and its creatures are entirely and unforgivingly repulsive.",
        "real_en": "After seven hundred years sealed inside the Crystal, I realized something. Everything in this world, every living thing, is ugly. Life itself is contemptible."
      },
